{
  "key": 19967,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaKeeperIntro",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: Welcome. I’m Primrose,\n",
        "keeper of the Academy’s Mega\r",
        "Stones.\r",
        "A Mega Stone isn’t a tool, you\n",
        "see. It’s a witness. It only\r",
        "answers to a bond it has seen\n",
        "proven with its own eyes.\r",
        "So I lend it to you. Your\n",
        "Pokémon carries it into battle\r",
        "against my three, with nobody\n",
        "else to lean on.\r",
        "Win, and the stone has chosen\n",
        "you both: it’s yours. Lose, and\r",
        "it comes back to me, and we wait\n",
        "until you’re ready. No shame in\r",
        "that."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaKeeperAsk",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: Which Pokémon will\n",
        "carry a stone?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaLater",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: The stones will wait.\n",
        "They’re good at it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaNoStone",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} doesn’t\n",
        "Mega Evolve. There’s no stone\r",
        "waiting for it, I’m afraid."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaHasAll",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}’s stone\n",
        "has already chosen you. Go and\r",
        "use it well!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaWhich",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: Two stones answer to\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0}. Which one?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_gStringVar1",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_gStringVar2",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaConfirm",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: {STRVAR_1 3, 2, 0} alone,\n",
        "holding the {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, against\r",
        "my three. Ready?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_gGymChallengeIntroText",
      "en_US": "(missing text)"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaWon",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: There. Did you feel\n",
        "it? The stone has chosen you\r",
        "both.\r",
        "The {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is yours to\n",
        "keep."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaPartyBack",
      "en_US": [
        "Your other Pokémon are back with\n",
        "you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaHasThis",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: That one’s already\n",
        "yours. Perhaps the other?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_Academy_Text_MegaLost",
      "en_US": [
        "Primrose: Not this time. The\n",
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} comes back to me.\r",
        "Train, think it over, and come\n",
        "back. It’ll be here."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0980_CV_CANVAS_ACADEMY_MEGA_ROOM_cv_unported",
      "en_US": [
